  "title": "Front and back vowels",
  "goal": "Make nouns plural with -lar and -ler by following the last vowel.",
  "points": ["gp-vowel-groups", "gp-harmony-2way", "gp-plural"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "Look at the **last vowel** of the word. After *e, i, ö, ü* (front vowels) the plural is *-ler*: *kalemler*. After *a, ı, o, u* (back vowels) it is *-lar*: *kitaplar*. This is vowel harmony.",
    "see": "gp-harmony-2way"
  },
